;    1: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ろかせっしょく, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=らんそう, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=6, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=フレアンマ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=167, unk2=8453888, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=295, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1181, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1074, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\zoo1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\動物園フラミンゴ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Oh, there they are! Flamingos!"<PG>
"The flamingo is a large waterbird with long webbed legs and a long neck, and on its head a specially shaped beak suited to <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="ろかせっしょく">filter feeding</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
It eats the floating <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="らんそう">blue-green algae</STYLE> of salt lakes, and lives in large flocks at salt lakes in arid regions, where it has few natural enemies. 
{PAUSE ""}
That's why flocks of tens of thousands are often seen flying, dyeing the sky pink, apparently."<PG>
"Its body is red because of the pigments of the <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="らんそう">blue-green algae</STYLE> it feeds on, β-carotene and canthaxanthin. 
{PAUSE ""}
Canthaxanthin, if I remember right, is the same as the red pigment in shrimp, crabs and octopus, and it has a strong antioxidant effect and is really good for your health."<PG>
"Um, the name flamingo comes from the Latin <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="フレアンマ">flamma</STYLE>, meaning flame, was it?
{PAUSE ""}
　Yeah, I think that's probably right. 
{PAUSE ""}
Right, <STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE>?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Huh? <STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE>? Why aren't you following me?
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE>, where are you?
{PAUSE ""}
　Daddy? Mommy?"<PG>
"Uuh... 
{PAUSE ""}
uuuh..."<PG>
"Waaaah! Daddyyy! Mommyyy! <STYLE ID="4">Siiis</STYLE>! Waaaaah!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"U-um, are you lost, maybe?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Sniffle..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"You're lost, then. What's your name?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Do you know your own name?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hmm, you're little, so maybe you can't say your name yet..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I won't go..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Don't go with strangers. Don't talk to them. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> always says so."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"O-oh, I see, you're more sensible than I thought. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Um, I'm a plainclothes patroller... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">not that you'd understand that, I guess..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Um, for now, let's go to the lost-child center. We'll wait there and have your dad or mom come get you, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No! I won't go!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Um, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Somebody! This person is a kidnapper!
{PAUSE ""}
　He's stringing together falsehoods like 'plainclothes patroller' and trying to violate me!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"H-hey! Hey now, I really am..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\五島桃子子供.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Erina<STYLE ID="4">! I finally found you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="4">Siiiis</STYLE>! Waaaah, I was scaaared!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Really, that was naughty. You mustn't get separated from Sis, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay... I'm sorry..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"There, there, </STYLE>Erina<STYLE ID="4">, you're a good girl. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">So, who's this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A kidnapper."<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"N-no! I'm a plainclothes patroller here at the Megasawa Zoo!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Here, my ID, see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh, it's true. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'm sorry my </STYLE>sister<STYLE ID="4"> caused you trouble..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"He's not a kidnapper? He's not a violator?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"No, this is a kind person who helps lost children find their daddies and mommies."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Really? So he was a good person."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ha ha ha... a-as long as you understand..."</STYLE><PG>
"Thank you very much! Goodbye!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Goodbye."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Haah, she's probably a smart kid, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">she's still a child after all..."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------